# Multiplayer architecture (pointer)

Full law: [`docs/docs/architecture/multiplayer.md`](../../docs/docs/architecture/multiplayer.md).

**Permanent decision:** design authority + replication with every shared
feature — never “MP later.” Cell / edge / client pipeline; presence follows
**mode** not ship existence; on-foot = client report + clamp; flight/combat
outcomes = cell. In-play place changes = authored markers only. Hab/Hangar
instances are real cells; team follow-in shares the owner's cell.
`interest ≤ cell size`.

When changing presence, cells, scene-exit / boarding cell resolve, instances,
follow-in, placeables, quantum/Warp Gate peers, or wire replication, read the
full doc first. Also listed in `AGENTS.md`.
